      "canonical_name": "Context assembly and byte budgets",
      "aliases": [
        "context byte budget",
        "source history context assembly",
        "interleaved context items"
      ],
      "definition": "Context assembly interleaves current source results with eligible historical events and applies a conservative serialized UTF-8 byte budget. It reports omissions and truncation without granting operational authority.",
